DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a beautiful evening under the stars on the Fountain Cour
 t with the Midsummer Mozart Festival Orchestra. The program features Mozar
 t’s Marriage of Figaro Overture\, Symphony No. 31 in D “Paris”\, Luc
 ia Silla Overture\, and the Sinfonie Concertante in E-flat for Violin\, Vi
 ola and Orchestra\, performed by soloists Robin Hansen\, violin\, and Eliz
 abeth Prior\, viola\, under the direction of guest conductor Ryan Murray.\
 n\nBoth Table Seating and Festival Seating are available. Lasagna Con Amor
 e Food Truck meals will be available for purchase beginning at 1 PM\, and 
 picnic tables are open for early picnicking. Concert seating opens at 5:45
