 orth celebrating. Grab a table or a seat by the fire pit\, order food and 
 drinks from Fieldwork\, located right next door\, and settle in for an eve
 ning of live music from local artist Brian Baudoin while the sun goes down
 .\n\nBrowse handmade goods and curated finds from local vendors\, and enjo
 y kids’ activities for the little ones. In June\, we’re shining a spot
 light on The Zones\, a local nonprofit youth center\, as our featured comm
 unity partner.\n\nSunset Socials kicks off Thursday\, June 25th\, and retu
