DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T183000
UID:260623LsVSAMUqbUyg4-d0xUOmlg
DESCRIPTION:A Live Paranormal Podcast Experience\n\nWhat if you discovered
  a hidden doorway that could reveal the life you almost lived?\n\nJoin us 
 for a one-night-only live performance set in the world of HOLLOW\, an orig
 inal mystery-drama television series currently being developed in Sonoma C
 ounty.\n\nPresented as a live recording of the fictional podcast The Hollo
 w Files\, the evening follows host Fisher as he interviews people who clai
 m to have encountered a mysterious phenomenon known as a Hollow—a place 
 said to reveal forgotten pasts\, alternate futures\, and lives that might 
 have been.\n\nThrough humor\, mystery\, and deeply personal stories\, audi
 ences will hear from guests who insist they found a Hollow and stepped ins
 ide.\n\nDid they really experience something impossible?\n\nOr is there an
 other explanation?
