UID:260619v4tcTOkMeUuYIJvCoNsqPw
DESCRIPTION:Experience stand-up comedy elevated!🌄\n\n​Join us on the 
 stunning outdoor terrace at Paradise Ridge Winery for an unforgettable nig
 ht of massive laughs and panoramic sunset views over Santa Rosa We are bri
 nging a heavy-hitting lineup of the Bay Area’s funniest touring comedian
 s straight to Fountaingrove\, featuring a massive feature and headliner\n\
 n​Come for the legendary wine country sunset\, stay for an elite lineup 
 of live comedy. Pair your evening with award-winning wines available for p
 urchase by the glass or bottle.\n\n​🗓️ EVENT DETAILS: Date: Friday\
