BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Secret Garden the Musical
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T220000
UID:260610nZdrrAget0qqgR7skUrVwA
DESCRIPTION:Step into a world of wonder\, mystery\, and renewal.\n\nCinnab
 ar Theater presents The Secret Garden The Musical\, the beloved story brou
 ght to life with a soaring score and breathtaking storytelling.\n\nOrphane
 d and sent to live with her reclusive uncle in a grand English manor\, you
 ng Mary Lennox discovers a hidden\, neglected garden. As she nurtures it b
 ack to life\, she awakens something magical—not only in the world around
  her\, but in the hearts of those who have long been closed off to hope.\n
 \nThis enchanting adaptation by Marsha Norman and Lucy Simon\, based on th
 e classic novel by Frances Hodgson Burnett\, is a moving tale of healing\,
  transformation\, and the power of nature.\n\n**Performance Dates & Times:
 **\n\nJune 12–June 28\, 2026\n\nFridays at 7:30 PM\n\nSaturdays at 7:30 
 PM\n\nSundays at 2:00 PM\n\nLearn more at cinnabartheater.org\n\n**Locatio
 n:**\n\nSonoma State University – Warren Theater (Ives Hall)\n\n1801 Eas
 t Cotati Ave\, Rohnert Park\, CA 94928\n\nRun Time:\n\nApproximately 2 hou
 rs 30 minutes\, including one 15-minute intermission\n\nRecommended For:\n
 \nAppropriate for all ages – perfect for families\n\n⸻\n\nCast:\n\nMar
 y Lennox: Violet Spears\n\nAlternate Mary Lennox: Serena Ridout\n\nColin C
 raven: Nathanael Koross\n\nAlternate Colin Craven: Joe Schulze\n\nArchibal
 d Craven: Ben Sasnett\n\nLily: Syona Ayyankeril\n\nRose / Dreamer: Katie V
 eale\n\nMartha: Nicole Stanley\n\nMrs. Medlock: Tika Moon\n\nBen Weatherst
 aff: Jonathan Spencer\n\nDickon: Beckett Hepp\n\nClaire / Dreamer: Natalie
  Burton\n\nAlice / Dreamer: Miriam Valencia\n\nMrs. Winthrop / Dreamer: Ka
 thi Brotemarkle\n\nAlbert / Dreamer: David A. Bradbury\n\nMajor Holmes & S
 helly / Dreamer: Noah Evans\n\nLt. Shaw / Dreamer: Corey Wilson\n\nLt. Wri
 ght / Dreamer: Mason Hunt\n\nNeville Craven: Zachary Hasbany\n\n⸻\n\nCre
 ative Team:\n\nJane Erwin: Director\n\nBrett Strader: Music Director\n\nBr
 idget Codoni: Choreographer\n\nElise Clark: Stage Manager\n\nJohn Sheridan
 : Assistant Stage Manager\n\nRoss Tiffany-Brown: Technical Director\n\nApr
 il George: Lighting Designer\n\nMateo Felix: Prop Designer / Co-Sound Desi
 gner\n\nDonnie Frank: Costume Designer & Hair/Makeup Designer\n\nPeter Cro
 mpton: Set Designer\n\nJohn Rustan: Dialect Coach\n\nLaurynn Malilay: Co-S
 ound Designer\n\nDiane Dragone: Executive Director\n\nNathan Cummings: Art
 istic Director\n\n⸻\n\nGetting to Sonoma State University:\n\nThe Warren
  Theater is located in Ives Hall on the Sonoma State University campus in 
 Rohnert Park. Plan to arrive early to allow time for parking and walking t
 o the venue.\n\nhttps://cinnabartheater.org/show/thesecretgarden/
LOCATION:Sonoma State University - Warren Theater\, Located in Ives Hall
URL:https://cinnabartheater.org/show/thesecretgarden/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SONGWRITERS IN THE ROUND - FOPPIANO WINERY
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T210000
UID:260610mfa4cCCiyU2cwab8MDCVZQ
DESCRIPTION:FOPPIANO WINERY\, in association with SECRET SONG CLUB present
 s songwriters in the round with Izzy Lilly and Dos Nikos (aka Finding Nico
  and Nicco Weisskoff).Spend the evening at our historic barn with an intim
 ate showcase of talented musicians\, and relax as the sun sets over the Ru
 ssian River Valley. Pack a picnic\, grab your friends\, and settle in for 
 a perfect summer night.\n\n✨ All ages welcome🍷 Wine on tap available 
 for purchase🧺 Picnic blankets + low-back chairs encouraged🐶 Friendly
 \, leashed dogs welcome🚫 No outside alcohol🚫 No glass containers\n\n
 This is a FREE event but RSVP's are encouraged.\n\nABOUT THE ARTISTS:\n\nI
 zzy Lilly is a Sebastopol native whose soulful folk-rock sound stems large
 ly from her vast musical upbringing\, listening and singing along to every
 thing from Heart and Fleetwood Mac to Amy Winehouse and The Chicks. Izzy i
 s currently working on her first ever EP\, set to be released later this y
 ear. https://linktr.ee/izzylilly\n\nNorth Bay music fans know Nicco Weiss
 koff as a gifted singer/songwriter in the indie folk / Americana scene. He
 's also a member of emo hip-hop group Dog Bones and half of the Sonoma Cou
 nty duo Dos Nikos. Highly recommend for fans of Elliott Smith\, Nick Drake
  and MJ Lenderman\, https://nicco.bandcamp.com/album/sky-writing\n\nFindi
 ng Nico's sound stems from a lot of different influences from Jimi Hendrix
  and The Black Keys to Mac DeMarco and Medium Build. Best known as the fro
 ntman of the band Finding Nico\, he also teams up with Nicco Weisskoff as 
 the indie rock duo Dos Nikos. https://www.instagram.com/finding.nic0/
LOCATION:Foppiano Winery
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/foppianovineyards/event/611005/wine-down-f
 ridays-music-at-the-foppiano-barn
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
