 board Vineyards in our Barrel Room\, located in downtown Healdsburg\, feat
 uring live music\, award-winning wine\, and hearty comfort food. Our Music
 \, Wine & Dine Night pairs the upbeat\, crowd-friendly sounds of Rootstock
 s with classic German-style fare from The Wurst.\n\nRootstocks brings an e
 nergetic mix of familiar favorites and feel-good tunes\, creating the perf
 ect soundtrack for a relaxed and social evening surrounded by barrels and 
 warm winery ambiance. Enjoy Longboard’s wines by the glass or bottle whi
 le The Wurst serves traditional sausages and savory sides\, made fresh and
  full of bold flavor.\n\nFriday | 5:00 PM – 7:00 PM Free entry\n\nPlease
  note: This is an over-21 event inside the Barrel Room. Under-21 guests an
 d leashed pets are welcome on the patio only.\n\nCome grab a seat early an
 d enjoy a classic Sonoma County night of great music\, great wine\, and gr
 eat food.\n\nWine available for purchase Live music by Rootstocks Food by 
 The Wurst \\(German-style sausages and comfort fare\\) Location: Longboard
  Vineyards Barrel Room Address: 5 Fitch Street\, Healdsburg\, CA 95448
