 f artistic exploration\, inspiration\, and community on Saturday\, June 27
 \, from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM in Santa Rosa. Artists\, instructors\, creativ
 e organizations\, and art material experts will come together to share dem
 onstrations\, hands-on activities\, techniques\, and creative experiences 
 designed to inspire artists of all ages and skill levels.\n\nWhether you'r
 e an experienced artist\, a student\, a hobbyist\, or simply curious about
  the creative process\, A Day to Create offers an opportunity to discover 
 new materials\, learn new techniques\, connect with fellow creatives\, and
  explore a wide variety of artistic disciplines. Admission is free\, and e
 veryone is welcome to participate in this celebration of creativity and co
 mmunity.
