 nce focused on reducing tension\, improving movement\, and promoting recov
 ery.\n\nUsing massage balls\, foam rollers\, and targeted stretching techn
 iques\, we’ll explore areas of common tightness and restriction througho
 ut the body.\n\nThis workshop is suitable for all levels and is a great op
 portunity to:\n\n• Release built-up stress and tension\n\n• Improve fl
 exibility and mobility\n\n• Support muscle recovery\n\n• Feel refreshe
 d\, restored\, and more connected to your body\n\nSpace is limited — res
