 sco and gospel beats\, this feel-good show is a celebration of music\, sis
 terhood\, and second chances. When disco diva Deloris Van Cartier witnesse
 s a crime\, she’s forced into hiding—in a convent! Disguised as a nun\
 , she transforms the struggling choir with her powerhouse voice\, helping 
