 asting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from ac
 ross the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll
  and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new s
 ounds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**Rambletone Blues Revue** Th
 e “Rambletone” blues revue is a hoppin’\, groovin’\, funky\, blues
 y band based in the San Francisco Bay Area. The members of Rambletone are 
 Tony Lemieux on vocals\, guitar and harmonica\, Ian Luke on drums\, Bob Fr
 uhlinger on bass\, Stu Dahlquist on guitars\, Willy Gross on saxophone and
  John Snee on keyboards.\n\n**Details**\n\nNo cover. Walk-ins are welcome\
 , but this event tends to fill up quickly\, so we recommend making a reser
 vation. We are dog and family friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/event/
