BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rush vs Yes
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T233000
UID:2605309QAVWpNY202z0zctkPMH_g
DESCRIPTION:Two powerhouse tributes collide for one epic night of progress
 ive rock mastery and musical spectacle! Two legendary catalogs go head-to-
 head as tribute acts honor Rush and Yes in an electrifying battle of prog 
 rock greatness. Fred Barchetta channels Rush’s classic era \\(1974–198
 2\\) with precision and energy. Born from acclaimed progressive outfit Poi
 nts North\, the band features world-class musicians who have toured alongs
 ide icons like Al Di Meola and Eric Johnson\, and includes powerhouse voca
 list Darby Gould\, known for her work with Jefferson Starship. Shine Delir
 ious brings the epic splendor of Yes to life with a Northern California su
 pergroup of seasoned performers. Since 2014\, they’ve earned a reputatio
 n for stunning five-part harmonies and virtuosic playing\, capturing the c
 omplexity and emotion of Yes’s most iconic works. Featuring members with
  credits ranging from tribute acts to film soundtracks and prog projects\,
  the band delivers a rich\, immersive experience full of texture\, inventi
 on\, and joy\, making this a must-see night for prog fans of every generat
 ion. Doors open at 6:30pm. Show at 7:30pm. This event uses Zoned Seating: 
 Seats within each zone are first-come-first-served. Ushers will seat you w
 ithin your chosen zone upon arrival. \\(Zone C does not guarantee a seat.\
 \) Check ticket descriptions for details\, & scroll down for a general zon
 e chart. Advance tickets: ZONE A: $35. ZONE B: $30. ZONE C \\[General Stan
 ding\\]: $25. Tickets at the door \\(Zone C only\\): $35 Our kitchen is op
 en and serving our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of inte
 rmission for events with more than 60 pre-sale tickets
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1945510489662354/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
