DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T170000
UID:260502gfucJ4Ui-UmD4ho7d_wHNQ
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you
  to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the
  Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, 
 a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026.\n\nThis wee
 k's lineup features Alabama Mike! Born in Talladega\, Alabama Mike’s ear
 ly influences were ZZ Hill\, Johnnie ‘Soul” Taylor\, Lightning Hopkins
  and Junior Wells. He has won various awards and has been nominated by The
  Blues Foundation on several occasions. In addition\, he has played major 
 festivals\, both domestically and internationally and is presently been re
 ferred to by some as the Future Of The Blues! \n\nSonoma Sundays are free
  and open to all\, thanks to the generous support of the Sonoma Community 
 Center\, The Dawn Redwoods Trust\, and the McNeely Family Foundation.\n\nP
 ack your picnic\, bring your dancing shoes\, and meet us on the Plaza!
LOCATION:Grinstead Amphitheater
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-6-14/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
