DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an intimate evening of Americana music\, storytelling\, 
 and collaboration at The California Theatre of Santa Rosa. Local songwrite
 rs Michael Capella\, Tom Richardson\, and Layne Bowen will share original 
 songs and the stories behind them\, blending acoustic and electric perform
 ances inspired by the rich traditions of Americana and roots music. Joinin
 g them are vocalist Gina Blaber\, drummer Dan Ransford\, and bassist Tim S
 arter\, creating a dynamic lineup that brings both original material and s
 elect covers to life. Together\, the musicians deliver a heartfelt perform
 ance celebrating the sounds\, influences\, and creativity that define the 
 Americana genre. Whether you're a fan of singer-songwriters\, roots rock\,
  or authentic live music\, this special evening offers a memorable showcas
 e of local talent in an intimate theater setting. Tickets are available in
  advance and at the door.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/songwriter-jam-at-the-california-theatre/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
