UID:260617O8rS7FXtgEm8dG98kKcbsQ
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to preserve fresh produce through pickling and ferme
 ntation in this hands-on workshop. You’ll explore both vinegar-based and
  salt-based methods while making a variety of flavorful recipes.\n\nIn thi
 s workshop you’ll:\n\n• Learn the basics of fermentation and vinegar p
 ickling\n\n• Understand the differences between fermented\, fresh\, and 
 refrigerator pickles\n\n• Make fermented curry cauliflower\, pickled asp
 aragus\, and spicy red onions\n\n• Learn how to safely store and continu
 e pickling at home\n\nYou’ll leave with three jars of your own creations
 . All materials provided.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/preserve-the-season-intro-to-pic
 kling-and-fermentation
