BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Friday Night Comedy - Danielle Arce & Nick Larson - Downtown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T220000
UID:2606249wAGBN9XG0uyBwM3yJY2gQ
DESCRIPTION:Friday night stand-up comedy in Downtown Santa Rosa\n\nVIP TAB
 LES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with preferred seating\, your own pr
 ivate call button to summon service\, and your first round of beer/cider (
 or a bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\nEvery Friday night hilarious comedia
 ns from The Bay Area and beyond perform at Barrel Proof Lounge. Stick arou
 nd after for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup of funny each Friday.\n\nThi
 s Week: Jon Lehre (host) Hayden Remi Headliners: Nick Larson & Danielle La
 rson\n\nDanielle Arce started stand-up comedy in 2011\, and has since perf
 ormed all over the country and overseas! She was featured on To Tell the T
 ruth on ABC & Hulu in 2021\, and has performed for the US Troops (Navy & M
 arines) in Japan. She's also performed in Australia\, and in festivals all
  over the country including New York City\, Phoenix\, and more. She's the 
 co-host of the Secret Minorities Podcast and is known for her quick\, dark
  & witty humor.\n\nNick Larson is an experienced\, Latino comedian from St
 ockton\, California. He has performed all over the US\, and regularly head
 lines and features at clubs and venues all along the West coast & Pacific 
 Northwest. Nick has been performing since 2012\, and is known for his goof
 y and silly sense of humor\, mining his unique family life for most of his
  comedy gold. He is also known for his hilarious riffing and crowd work\, 
 while seamlessly weaving it into his prepared material. He is a co-host fo
 r two popular comedy podcasts\, including "Joke Me Off Podcast" with fello
 w Latino comedian\, Saul Trujillo\, and "Secret Minorities" with Latina co
 median\, Danielle Arce. Nick has been interviewed and featured for Comedy 
 Network Live and has won many comedy competitions in The Bay Area and Cent
 ral Valley.\n\n21+ Doors - 7p / Show - 8p $15adv / $20door\n\nCheck out **
 wwww.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/friday-night-comedy-danielle-arce-nick-la
 rson-downtown-santa-rosa-tickets-1990246979291
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
