BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:GILL BROTHERS BAND JULY 4TH
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260704T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260704T170000
UID:2606225Z3qKVM5Gkq_BUEDd_EHqg
DESCRIPTION:Grab a lawn chair and celebrate the 4TH OF JULY at FOPPIANO 
 with a raucous afternoon of live music at the barn featuring GILL BROTHE
 RS BAND and TOM RELLING.\n\nSip new FOPPIANO WINES ON TAP\, kick back 
 with friends and enjoy plenty of toe-tappin' fun before the evening firewo
 rks begin.TACOS EL GRAN MAC will be cooking up SMASHBURGERS\, DANGER DOGS\
 , STREET TACOS and QUESADILLAS.\n\n🕕 2–5 PM🎟️Tickets $10 in adv
 ance / $15 at the door✨ All ages welcome\n\n🍷 Wine on tap available f
 or purchase\n\n🐶 Friendly\, leashed dogs welcome\n\n🚫 No outside alc
 ohol🚫 No glass containers\n\nABOUT GILL BROTHERS BAND:\n\nHailing from 
 the idyllic peaks of Cobb Mountain\, the Gill Brothers have carried the cr
 aft of guitar and song together for over a decade. With amplifiers turned 
 to ten\, brothers Jacob and Connor wield mean\, fluid\, cutting\, scuttlin
 g lead guitars that echo from coast to coast across these United States.Th
 eir sound combines dueling lead guitar work inspired by the likes of AC/DC
 \, The Outlaws\, and Thin Lizzy with surrealist storytelling delivered thr
 ough a laid-back twang\, reminiscent of alternative rock and country acts 
 such as The Beat Farmers\, Dinosaur Jr.\, and Drive-By Truckers.With a uni
 que and heartfelt synthesis of American rock\, country\, and blues styling
 s\, Gill Brothers Band pushes towards a new sonic frontier\, blowing the r
 oof off every dirty dive they play\, barreling down Highway 175 to the nex
 t gig.Gill Brothers Band just released their second full-length album\, "T
 he Hollow Mountain" in June 2026.
LOCATION:Foppiano Vineyards
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/foppianovineyards/event/611905/july-4th-gi
 ll-brothers-band
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
