DESCRIPTION:Press Release for Dirty Cello Performs twice on 4th of July \
 n\nThe ever busy world traveling band Dirty Cello has two great 4th of Jul
 y shows coming up in Sonoma County - at opposite ends.\n\nFor the early bi
 rds\, they’ll be doing a lunchtime show at a new venue in Monte Rio call
 ed Wonderland Pizza from 12:30- 2:30. \n\nIf you want to keep the party g
 oing\, once the weather cools down they’ll be at Penngrove Pub for a sem
 i- outdoor show from  7 - 10 pm. Penngrove Pub has an amazing stage and t
 his venue is known for its relaxed and fun vibe.\n\nAt both shows  Dirty 
 Cello will be presenting their signature blend of classic rock\, wailing b
 lues and high energy bluegrass. The band has been described as "Dirty Cell
 o’s music is all over the map: funky\, carnival\, romantic\, sexy\, tang
 led\, electric\, fiercely rhythmic\, and textured\, and only occasionally 
 classical." by Oakland Magazine.
