UID:260618yhFJUdqGa0Kw6kJ8h2poIw
DESCRIPTION:Billy is an entertainer extraordinaire\, capable of throwing d
 own a blues show that can be infectiously hilarious and convincingly nasty
 . His energy as a frontman is relentless\, his vocals inspiring\, and his 
 harp work musically outstanding. Billy's repertoire ranges from creepy gro
 oves\, grinding shuffles\, to fast boogies and swings. Yet audiences do no
 t flock to his shows simply for his mastery of the harmonica... they are d
 rawn by his magnetic stage personality and the idea of never knowing what 
 antic may be next!
LOCATION:Kelsey Creek Brewing Company
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1342308134447822/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Artist Accelerator 2026 Spring Cohort Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260705T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260705T160000
UID:260612G3mSGM9J7kGCJNf4YFse3w
DESCRIPTION:Artist Accelerator 2026 Spring Cohort Exhibition! Exhibition w
 ill be on view from June 18 - July 20 at the Robert F. Agrella Art Gallery
  at Santa Rosa Junior College - on the first floor of the Frank P. Doyle L
 ibrary\, first door to the left by the entrance. The 2026 Spring Cohort of
  the Artist Accelerator Program - a professional development partnership b
 etween Creative Sonoma and Sebastopol Center for the Arts - invites you to
  experience their latest creations\, now on display! New works by : Ash Au
 stin Sibyl Bugarian Cheyenne Giovannucci Elena Miska Sky Sade Steve Scavo 
 Xiaojie Zheng Their inspiring collection of new works in painting\, mixed 
 media\, and ceramics is beautifully curated at Santa Rosa Junior College.
