  humor\, and decades of work writing for Hollywood's biggest stars\, Bruce
  will join us for a special appearance\, sharing stories\, insights\, and 
 plenty of laughs from a remarkable career in entertainment and LGBTQ+ advo
 cacy.\n\nEnjoy outstanding local wine\, delicious bites\, and an intimate 
 gathering of supporters who help make Russian River Pride's programs\, eve
 nts\, and community grants possible.\n\nWhether you're a fan of Bruce Vila
 nch\, a lover of great wine\, or simply looking for a fabulous evening out
 \, Pride Uncorked offers the perfect blend of community\, conversation\, c
 elebration\, and giving back.\n\n🥂 Local Wine ⭐ Special Guest Bruce V
 ilanch 🌈 Community Celebration 💖 Supporting Russian River Pride\n\nJ
 oin us for an unforgettable evening where every glass raised helps strengt
 hen and support the LGBTQ+ community in the Russian River region.\n\nSeats
  are limited. Reserve yours today! Must be 21+ to attend.
LOCATION:Russian River Vineyards
URL:https://PrideUncorked.eventbrite.com/?aff=pressdemocrat
