DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T200000
UID:260529sX76wq8Kk0Sfi_XEpeITyQ
DESCRIPTION:Date: Friday\, July 10\, 2026\n\nTime: Doors 6 PM | Show 8 P
 M\n\nTickets: $20 Advance | $25 Door\n\nRising quickly through the tribut
 e ranks\, RagDolls has garnered the type of critical acclaim - in the span
  of a few years - that takes most tributes years to achieve.  Delivering 
 energetic and powerful performances\, RagDolls dig deep into the soul of A
 merica's greatest rock and roll band. If imitation is the greatest form of
  flattery\, then it is blatantly clear that these women capture the essenc
 e of Aerosmith out of a love for the music and its energy. Their ultimate 
 goal: to leave audiences feeling like they've experienced the real thing.
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/ragdolls---aerosmith-tribute-710-p236.as
 px
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:TAKE YOUR TIME: Oil Pintings by Sharon Eisley
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T170000
UID:260529UXoQO3816keoinqRjwwsqw
DESCRIPTION:“Take Your Time”\n\nChange and transformation take time. I
 n her newest oil paintings Sharon Eisley explores the time as a process. B
 e it moving through grief\, re-framing your story of self\, or birthing so
 me new creation\, each painting lures you in with beautiful application th
 en holds you in time for a closer examination of our human experience. Eis
 ley's paintings are all inspired by tarot cards and her personal journey. 
 Tarot readings will be offered at the reception by @SymbolWarehouse for an
  optional small donation.\n\nOur guest artist\, Robert Benson\, will be ch
 allenging your eyes to fill in the details with his impressionist watercol
 ors.\n\nThis June 20th reception will be the FINAL art opening for Sebasto
 pol Gallery in its home of almost 20 years! This show may last only throug
 h June 2026\, then move to our new location. Or it may be up through June 
 and July. Either way\, this will be your last chance to come celebrate our
  local\, amazing group of artists at 150 N Main St.. “Take Your Time” 
 is a reminder to our collective to take our time finding and setting up ou
 r new home for all of you. I hope you can all come celebrate all the time 
 and art we shared with you in our lovely gallery.\n\nwww.sharoneisley.com
LOCATION:Sebastopol Gallery
URL:http://sebastopolgallery.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Revolutionary Love is the Call of our Times
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T210000
UID:260519g7EyHQ0vMkylZsCM0FBlMg
DESCRIPTION:with Valarie Kaur and Sonny Singh\n\nJoin social justice leade
 r\, author\, and spiritual visionary Valarie Kaur and acclaimed musician S
 onny Singh on a journey into ancestral wisdom through music and meditation
 . Together\, we’ll sit with the question: Who do I want to be in this mo
 ment in history? We’ll unlock the wisdom within\, build sovereign space\
 , and imagine a future of liberation.\n\nImmerse yourself in the stories a
 nd song-prayers of their Sikh ancestors who called us to become sant-sipah
 i — sage warriors. The sage sees through the eyes of love\; the warrior 
 puts that love into action. What does the call to love look like today?
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/revolutionary-love-is-
 the-call-of-our-times-vk1e26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
