UID:260529zJ9ZbSMt2Um41Vvs_8_8Fw
DESCRIPTION:America at 250 — a night of rebellion\, champagne\, and the 
 unveiling of something written… in secret. In honor of America’s 250th
  anniversary\, Jean-Charles Boisset invites you to experience Le Club thro
 ugh an extravagant 1776-inspired costume soirée infused with French flair
 . Step into a world of powdered glamour\, embroidered coats\, silk gowns\,
  candlelit decadence\, and museum-worthy treasures imported from France. G
 uests will sip fine wines\, enjoy curated entertainment\, and indulge in e
 nticing food stations featuring elevated French and American favorites whi
 le immersed in the grandeur of 18th-century France\, reimagined through th
 e lens of Creator Jean-Charles Boisset. As the evening unfolds\, Jean-Char
 les will unveil a hidden creation written in secret and revealed for the v
 ery first time to those in attendance. Costumes encouraged. Details reserv
 ed for confirmed guests.
