BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Boots\, Brims\, & Barrels
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T203000
UID:260425mKeq6ZUvQUmtRVM4K1NkxA
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable evening at Dutton Ranch\, overloo
 king our historic\, family-farmed vineyards and golden-hour views.\n\nSett
 le in for a laid-back yet elevated wine country experience featuring live 
 music by Dustin Saylor\, Dutton Estate wines grown right here on the ranch
 \, and classic barbecue inspired by the season. Add a little Western flair
  to your evening by creating your own custom hat at the Bosworth Hat Bar p
 erfect for sipping in style.\n\nWhether you’re a wine club member or joi
 ning us for the first time\, we invite you to kick back\, connect\, and ce
 lebrate the season with us at the event of the summer.\n\nYour ticket purc
 hase will include a 2 for 1 Vineyard Garden Tasting Valued at $40.
LOCATION:Dutton Ranch
URL:https://www.duttonestate.com/winery-events/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Morning Hike and Tasting at the Ridge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260711T110000
UID:260420PgXNGxwJBkis92SLeorQoA
DESCRIPTION:As featured in San Francisco Chronicle list of “10 wine tast
 ings in Napa and Sonoma with ‘wellness’ activities like hiking\, bikin
 g and yoga”\n\nEmbark on a guided “grape-to-glass” journey that begi
 ns with artisan trail treats before ascending into our dramatically terrac
 ed hillside vineyards.\n\nAs you navigate the estate\, your host will prov
 ide deep insights into our diverse ecosystems and the geological significa
 nce of our Stags Leap District location. You will explore why these distin
 ct sites produce such storied wines while enjoying a comparative tasting t
 hat showcases the nuance and variation across our premier appellations.\n\
 n**Pricing:** $100 per guest | $80 per club member\n\n**Availability:** Gr
 oups of 1–12 guests\n\n**Pace:** Moderate hike with challenging inclines
 \; weather permitting\n\n**Attire:** Strictly no open-toed shoes. Appropri
 ate hiking footwear is require
LOCATION:Pine Ridge Vineyards
URL:https://www.pineridgevineyards.com/events/morning-hike-and-tasting-at-
 the-ridge/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
