DESCRIPTION:Every second Saturday of the month enjoy free admission all da
 y long at the Museum of Sonoma County.This month explore the exhibitions t
 he museum has on view including a new exhibition featuring the history of 
 Santa Rosa! We will be displaying rarely seen maps of the city\, showcasin
 g centuries of change and expansion.Afterwards check out our 36th Annual A
 rtistry in Wood exhibition and get inspired to make your own leaf print.Ac
 tivities from 11 am to 1 pm.Museum is open from 11 am to 5 pm.
