UID:260616pTZt7EtzB06xPkElXU_xZg
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Independence Day at Sonoma Plaza with one of the nat
 ion's top-rated Fourth of July festivities. The day begins with a communit
 y parade winding around the historic Plaza\, followed by a family-friendly
  festival featuring food\, drinks\, games\, and activities hosted by local
  nonprofit organizations. Proceeds from the festival support Sonoma's nonp
 rofit community. Throughout the afternoon\, visitors can enjoy the festive
  atmosphere\, community spirit\, and classic holiday traditions in the hea
 rt of Sonoma. As evening approaches\, the celebration culminates with a sp
 ectacular fireworks display over General Vallejo's field\, lighting up the
  night sky in honor of America's independence. This beloved annual event b
 rings residents and visitors together for a full day of patriotic fun\, en
 tertainment\, and community celebration.
LOCATION:Sonoma Plaza
