DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun\, meaningful summer activity for your kids? 
 Camp Nova is the perfect place for 11-13 year olds to learn life-saving sk
 ills while having a blast and making new friends!\n\nLocation & Details\n\
 nWhere: Rancho Cotate High School\n\nWho: Open to all youth aged 11-13\n\n
 What We Do\n\nWe focus on teaching the basics of first aid through engagin
 g\, hands-on activities. Plus\, this is an amazing opportunity for your ch
 ild to earn official Red Cross certifications\, including:\n\nBabysitter C
 ertification and possibly CPR\n\nCertification (depending on individual as
 sessment/course completion requirements)\n\nGive your child the confidence
  to handle emergencies\, look after younger siblings\, or start their firs
 t babysitting job with pride.\n\nSpaces Are Limited - Sign Up Today!
LOCATION:Rancho Cotate High School 
