BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Evening with the Stinkfoot Orchestra featuring Napoleon Murphy 
 Brock!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260717T210000
UID:260514T3-R44pJTk-3L_i4GYpdxQ
DESCRIPTION:The Stinkfoot Orchestra is a 14 piece Frank Zappa tribute band
 \, featuring Zappa alum Napoleon Murphy Brock. Doors open at 8pm\, show st
 arts at 9pm.
LOCATION:Mystic Theater
