DESCRIPTION:Ledson Summer Soirée at Ledson Winery & Vineyards returns Jul
 y 17-19\, 2026\, for a memorable weekend celebrating the 110th birthday of
  Noble Ledson with exceptional wine\, food\, and family tradition. The fes
 tivities begin on Friday\, July 17\, from 5-7 PM with an intimate Winemake
 r Dinner at Stella Restaurant featuring a specially crafted menu and outst
 anding wines. On Saturday\, July 18\, from 6-8:30 PM\, guests can enjoy a 
 Progressive Wine & Food Pairing at Ledson Castle\, showcasing six highly r
 ated wines paired with dishes from Sonoma County chefs\, followed by music
  and dancing beneath the stars. Throughout the celebration\, wine tastings
  will be available July 16-19 from 10 AM-4 PM at Ledson Castle in Kenwood 
 and Zina Lounge in Sonoma. This special weekend honors a remarkable family
  legacy through acclaimed wines\, shared stories\, and unforgettable exper
 iences in the heart of Sonoma Valley.
LOCATION:Ledson Winery & Vineyards
