 sion of the feet\, and the elegance of the upper body.\n\nArm Artistry: L
 earn to move your arms from the back/shoulder blades for a continuous\, 
 “liquid” look.\n\nThe Power of the Core: Mastering hip movement and r
 ibcage isolations for authentic Latin motion.\n\nPoise in Motion: Drills 
 to improve balance during spins while maintaining beautiful hand lines.\n\
 n“Confidence is your best accessory. Come learn how to own your space an
 d dance with heart.”\n\nEvent Details When: Saturday\, JULY 18 Time: 1
 :00 PM – 2:00 PM\n\nWhere: Salsa Dance Marin\, 4140 Redwood Hwy 8\, San 
 Rafael Teacher: Fernanda Cedeno\n\nWhat to Bring Comfortable shoes \\(flat
 s or dance heels are great—avoid super grippy sneakers if possible\\). A
  bottle of water.\n\nTickets: $25\, at the door $30
