DESCRIPTION:Ease into Sunday afternoons with live music and estate wines a
 t Cuvaison. Throughout July\, join us for relaxed tasting experiences feat
 uring acoustic performances set against the beautiful backdrop of Tai Vi
 neyard. \n\nYour tasting includes 5 wines and light bites enjoyed on the 
 patio while taking in vineyard views and soaking in the easy rhythm of sum
 mer in Los Carneros.\n\nGroup Size: Up to 6 guests\, including non-tasters
 \n\nDuration: Please allow 90 minutes for this experience
