 ated wines paired with dishes from Sonoma County chefs\, followed by music
  and dancing beneath the stars. Throughout the celebration\, wine tastings
  will be available July 16-19 from 10 AM-4 PM at Ledson Castle in Kenwood 
 and Zina Lounge in Sonoma. This special weekend honors a remarkable family
