  quartet inspired by the Great American Songbook\, blending swing\, early 
 blues\, and classic American styles into a lively journey through American
  music history. Led by vocalist and bassist Dorian Bartley\, the Petaluma-
 based acoustic quartet features Doug Morton on piano and clarinet\, Peter 
 Graves on saxophone\, and Tony Blake on drums.
